WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 052. A STRAIN NAME IS NOT A PRODUCT MODEL.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
COMPARE COMPOSITION, FORMAT, CONTEXT, GOALS, CONSTRAINTS, AND MISSING EVIDENCE.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
SIMILAR LABELS DO NOT ESTABLISH EQUIVALENCE, EFFECT, QUALITY, OR FIT.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
DECLARED BANDS ARE NOT DOSES, LAB RESULTS, VERIFIED LABELS, OR PREDICTED EXPERIENCES.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
COMPARE PRODUCTS—DO NOT RANK, RECOMMEND, OR MATCH ONE TO A PERSON.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
LOOK BEYOND THE NAME. KEEP COMPOSITION, CONTEXT, UNCERTAINTY, AND GOALS VISIBLE.
